    "details": "<p data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"186\">Each team will be assigned a <strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"79\">real brand</strong> and will be responsible for <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"185\">reimagining and executing its marketing strategy for a period of 3 months</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"371\">Teams will first analyse the brand, identify gaps and growth opportunities, and then build a strategy to improve its <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"370\">brand visibility, engagement, positioning, and overall growth</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"530\">There are <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"428\">no fixed limitations on what teams can do</strong>. They have complete creative freedom to decide what will work best for the brand. This could include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"948\">\n<li data-section-id=\"l4pen2\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"576\">Social media content, campaigns &amp; posts</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ugv7ye\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"616\">Reels and short-form video content</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"154e1ow\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"660\">Performance marketing &amp; paid campaigns</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"j3l45m\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"701\">Influencer &amp; creator collaborations</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10s541j\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"727\">SEO &amp; GEO strategies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jszjw4\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"758\">️ Content marketing &amp; blogs</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1oeprio\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"797\">Brand positioning &amp; communication</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"skafod\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"842\">Growth experiments &amp; community building</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3gpaq3\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"883\">AI-powered marketing and automation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tx4ebq\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"948\">Or any other innovative strategy they believe can drive growth</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"vl5c1u\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"973\"><strong>Powered by IcyPluto</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1101\">To help teams build and execute their strategies, <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1066\">each team will get access to IcyPluto</strong>, an Agentic AI marketing platform.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1353\">Teams can use IcyPluto to <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1264\">analyse the brand's AI visibility, understand competitors, identify opportunities, develop SEO &amp; GEO strategies, and create content </strong>giving them access to AI-powered tools while they work on their 3-month growth strategy.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1602\">The goal is not simply to create a presentation. Teams will need to <strong data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1464\">think like the brand's marketing team</strong>, make strategic decisions, experiment with different approaches, and demonstrate how they can create meaningful growth over three months.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1731\"><strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1731\">The winning team will be the one that combines strong strategy, creative execution, smart use of AI, and measurable impact.</strong></p>",
